[
  "Betelgeuse red supergiant in JWST near-infrared, massive convection cells bubbling across photosphere like boiling mercury, pre-supernova chromosphere ejecting asymmetric mass-loss plumes cranked amber-scarlet, surrounding dust shells glowing concentric orange rings, tiny exploration-craft silhouette at lower-left for scale, background Orion Nebula blazing magenta-blue.",
  "Quasar OJ 287 binary supermassive black hole system in multi-wavelength composite, primary accretion disk warping violet-white in x-ray flare, secondary black hole punching through disk ejecting shocked jet-stream, gravitational lensing smearing background galaxy into Einstein cross, ionized halo cranked electric cyan saturation.",
  "Asteroid 16 Psyche close-up radar composite, metallic NiFe surface cratered with iron veins glittering chrome-silver, NASA Psyche-mission probe silhouette mid-approach for scale, dust streams from micrometeorite impacts suspended in zero-gravity halo, deep black space with lensed quasar background glowing faint blue.",
  "Saturn rings backlit by sun in Cassini visible-light composite, Cassini-division gap razor-sharp, Enceladus ice geyser plumes erupting foreground spraying cryovolcanic vapor jets, ring shadows banding planet's northern hemisphere, Titan distant with methane-cloud storms visible, miniature refinery-platform silhouette at frame edge.",
  "Crab Pulsar PSR B0531+21 at nebula heart in Hubble-Chandra composite, twin gamma-ray beams sweeping lighthouse-pattern, magnetar wind torus inflating ionized purple-blue bubble, supernova remnant filaments cranked emerald-amber optical, x-ray pulsar wind nebula glowing electric cyan, derelict research-probe drifting lower-right.",
  "Antennae Galaxies NGC 4038/4039 mid-merger in JWST-Hubble composite, tidal-arm bridge of disrupted stars stretching between cores, induced starburst regions blazing pink H-alpha ionization, two supermassive black holes fusing at galactic-center cyan flare, surrounding intergalactic medium glowing infrared amber.",
  "Exoplanet TRAPPIST-1e terrestrial in artist-spectrograph composite, cracked ice ocean surface with subsurface liquid water thermal vents glowing amber cracks, stellar twin sunset with M-dwarf stars crimson-orange horizon, auroral curtains at magnetic poles cranked violet-green saturation, atmospheric water-vapor clouds swirling.",
  "Comet 67P Churyumov-Gerasimenko close-up in Rosetta visible-light, multi-jet active sublimation erupting from sunlit nucleus cliffs, ion tail stretching 100,000 kilometers behind cranked electric blue, dust tail amber-brown spreading wide, surface rubble-pile texture visible, mining-drone cluster silhouette approaching for scale.",
  "M87 supermassive black hole shadow in EHT 230GHz radio composite, photon-ring rim glowing asymmetric from Doppler boosting, accretion disk turbulence cranked orange-white x-ray flare, relativistic jet shooting 5,000 light-years into elliptical halo, background lensed galaxy smeared into double-image arc.",
  "Eta Carinae homunculus nebula in HST-JWST composite, bipolar lobes inflating with shocked stellar ejecta pearl-white, central Wolf-Rayet LBV star pre-supernova convection visible, surrounding Carina Nebula blazing red H-alpha background, ionization fronts cascading outward cranked magenta-cyan, exploration-craft silhouette lower-right.",
  "Jupiter Great Red Spot in JWST infrared, turbulent vortex mid-rotation with surrounding storm bands cranked vivid amber-cyan, twin volcanic plumes erupting from Io silhouetted transiting, Europa visible upper-right with surface ice cracks glowing faint blue, magnetosphere aurora ring at poles, Juno-probe dot lower-left.",
  "Quasar 3C 273 in multi-wavelength composite, brilliant blue-white accretion disk warping in Chandra x-ray view, twin polar jets shooting 200,000 light-years across Hubble visible, gravitational lensing of background galaxy smearing into Einstein arc lower-right, ionized halo cranked electric magenta saturation.",
  "Vesta asteroid close-up in Dawn mission visible-light, Rheasilvia impact crater basin dominating southern hemisphere with central peak visible, grooved equatorial troughs carved deep, varied albedo patches showing basaltic composition cranked rust-gray contrast, asteroid-mining rig silhouette with drilling apparatus approaching northern pole for scale.",
  "Centaurus A NGC 5128 active galaxy in ALMA-Chandra composite, central dust lane bisecting elliptical core jet-black contrast, twin radio lobes inflating 600,000 light-years across cranked orange-white, supermassive black hole jet shooting blue x-ray beam through galactic core, surrounding globular clusters glittering.",
  "Magnetar SGR 1806-20 in Chandra x-ray composite, starquake fracture cracking neutron-star crust mid-flare, gamma-ray burst frying surrounding ionosphere electric violet, magnetosphere twisted field lines visible in iron emission, background supernova remnant filaments glowing amber, science-vessel silhouette at safe distance lower-left.",
  "Neptune banded cyan-violet in Voyager-Hubble composite, Great Dark Spot vortex raging southern hemisphere with white methane cirrus clouds streaking, smaller Dark Spot-2 forming northern hemisphere, atmospheric winds at 2,100 km/h visible in band motion, Triton distant with nitrogen geysers erupting pink plumes.",
  "Cartwheel Galaxy AM 0644-741 in JWST infrared, ring-shock cascade expanding outward from galactic collision center, induced starburst regions blazing pink-white in outer ring, spoke structures connecting core to ring glowing amber dust lanes, companion galaxies visible left-frame having punched through disk.",
  "Sirius A+B binary system in Hubble visible-light composite, white dwarf B accretion stream siphoning material from A's photosphere cranked blue-white plasma arc, diffraction spikes from A's brilliance dominating frame, surrounding Gould Belt stellar nursery glowing faint pink background, freighter-silhouette transiting lower-right.",
  "Bennu asteroid 101955 in OSIRIS-REx close-up visible-light, rubble-pile structure spinning with boulders suspended in micro-gravity, Nightingale crater showing exposed subsurface organics darker patches, solar wind sputtering dust halo around equator, touch-and-go sample-collector probe silhouette descending northern hemisphere for scale.",
  "Cygnus Loop supernova remnant in HST-Chandra composite, Veil Nebula filaments backlit by central pulsar wind cranked emerald-cyan ionized oxygen, shock-front expanding at 1.5 million km/h visible blue-white edge, surrounding interstellar medium glowing faint red H-alpha, distant background galaxies lensed into arcs.",
  "TON 618 ultramassive black hole accretion disk in x-ray composite, turbulent plasma churning violet-white at innermost stable orbit, photon ring warping from relativistic frame-dragging, surrounding quasar ionization cone shooting megaparsec-scale jet cranked electric blue, lensed background galaxy cluster smeared into arcs.",
  "Mars Olympus Mons in HiRISE visible-light, planet-wide dust storm sweeping caldera rim with particulate orange clouds billowing, volcanic summit ice cap glowing white contrast, Valles Marineris canyon system visible horizon-edge, thin CO2 atmosphere auroral glow at polar terminator, surveying-skiff silhouette orbiting lower-left.",
  "Cat's Eye Nebula NGC 6543 planetary in Hubble-Chandra composite, concentric shells expanding outward from dying white dwarf central star, ionized nitrogen cranked red-orange outer halos, helium inner bubble glowing electric green, x-ray emission showing 1,000-degree shocked wind, surrounding dense star field blazing.",
